# Dashboard Categorical Overview Fixes - Walkthrough

## Summary

Successfully fixed the Categorical Emissions Overview dashboard issues:
1. ✅ Enhanced categorical breakdown to show full **Activity → Division → Region** hierarchy
2. ✅ Added **tCO₂e units** to mitigation display for better readability
3. ✅ Improved **number formatting** consistency across the dashboard
4. ✅ Updated subtitles to clarify grouping structure

## Changes Made

### 1. Enhanced Categorical Breakdown ([dashboard.js](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/h/public/dashboard.js#L439-L520))

**What was changed:**
- Completely rewrote the [loadCategoricalBreakdown()](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/h/public/dashboard.js#423-595) function to create a proper three-level hierarchy
- Data is now grouped: Activity → Division → Region
- Added visual hierarchy with:
  - **Activity headers** (EP, LQS, RPC, TRC) in large bold text with accent color border
  - **Division subheaders** in medium gray text under each activity
  - **Region cards** under each division showing individual regional emissions

**Visual improvements:**
- Cards now have hover effects (background brightens, border color changes to accent)
- Proper spacing and indentation to show hierarchy
- Field information displayed alongside region name when available
- Consistent tCO₂e unit formatting across all cards

**Code structure:**
```javascript
// Creates hierarchy object: hierarchy[activity][division] = [regions...]
const hierarchy = {};
data.forEach(item => {
    const act = item.activity || 'Unassigned';
    const div = item.division || 'Unknown';
    if (!hierarchy[act]) hierarchy[act] = {};
    if (!hierarchy[act][div]) hierarchy[act][div] = [];
    hierarchy[act][div].push(item);
});
```

### 2. Mitigation Number Formatting

#### [dashboard.html](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/h/public/dashboard.html#L418)
**Before:**
```html
Less <span id="mitigation-total" style="color:#fff;">0</span> Mitigation
```

**After:**
```html
Less <span id="mitigation-total" style="color:#10b981; font-weight:600;">0</span> tCO₂e Mitigation
```

**Changes:**
- Added **tCO₂e** units for clarity
- Changed color to **green** (#10b981) to match the "Net Emissions" theme
- Added `font-weight:600` for better visual prominence

#### [dashboard.js](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/h/public/dashboard.js#L357)
**Before:**
```javascript
mitigation.toLocaleString(undefined, { minimumFractionDigits: 2 })
```

**After:**
```javascript
mitigation.toLocaleString(undefined, { minimumFractionDigits: 2, maximumFractionDigits: 2 })
```

**Changes:**
- Added `maximumFractionDigits: 2` to ensure consistent formatting
- Now shows exactly 2 decimal places (e.g., "1,234.56" instead of "1,234.567891")

