## Carbon Intensity Year Filter Fix

### Added "All Years" Option ([carbon-intensity.js](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/h/public/carbon-intensity.js#L36-L43))

**What was added:**
- New "All Years" option at the top of the year dropdown
- Users can now view carbon intensity data across all available years instead of being limited to individual years

**Code added:**
```javascript
// Add "All Years" option first
const allYearsOpt = document.createElement('div');
allYearsOpt.className = 'dropdown-option';
allYearsOpt.dataset.value = 'all';
allYearsOpt.textContent = 'All Years';
optionsContainer.appendChild(allYearsOpt);
```

**User experience:**
- Navigate to Carbon Intensity page
- Click the year dropdown
- See "All Years" as the first option
- Select to view aggregated data across all years
